	<section_number>38.2-3302</section_number>
	<catch_line>How premiums payable</catch_line>
	<text>
		Each individual life insurance policy shall have a provision that all premiums after the first premium shall be payable in advance.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 38-371(1); 1950, p. 179; 1952, c. 317, § 38.1-391; 1986, c. 562.</history>
